# Everything the image build does not read. Size of the build context is the
# smaller half of the point: an entry here also means a change to that file
# cannot invalidate a cache layer, which is why CI config and prose are
# excluded even though they are tiny.

.git
.github
bin
tmp
coverage.out

# Reinstalled from the lockfile inside the build. Copying the host tree in
# would be slow and would risk shipping native modules built for the wrong
# architecture.
web/node_modules

# A previously built dashboard must not leak in. The web stage rebuilds it
# and copies the result over this path, so a stale copy here would be
# silently replaced - after being sent over the wire on every build.
internal/webui/dist/assets
internal/webui/dist/index.html

# Prose, except the design document the frontend token guards read.
*.md
!docs/DESIGN.md
